.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ckman-piv-objects-name 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-piv\-objects\-name \- Read or set a slot\*(Aqs UTF\-16 container name (firmware 3.1+)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-piv\-objects\-name\fR [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-management\-key\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISLOT\fR> [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read or set a slot\*(Aqs UTF\-16 container name (firmware 3.1+)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-management\-key\fR \fI<MANAGEMENT_KEY>\fR
Current management key as 48 hex characters (prompted when needed)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISLOT\fR>
PIV slot (9a, 9c, 9d, 9e, retired 82\-95, or f9 for attestation)
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
The name to set; omit to print the current one, empty to clear
